{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-58","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the fifth binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called the side of a rational plus a medial area.","book":10,"number":58,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":58,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","contentId":"euclid-10-58","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41b90a85f248d0dd5b7fd15ebb8d056089d0ac8306d75e0435d749a94e96d764","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-58.statement","euclid-10-58.construction.1","euclid-10-58.construction.2","euclid-10-58.proof.1","euclid-10-58.proof.2","euclid-10-58.proof.3","euclid-10-58.proof.4","euclid-10-58.proof.5","euclid-10-58.proof.6","euclid-10-58.proof.7","euclid-10-58.proof.8","euclid-10-58.conclusion","euclid-10-58.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-58.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"710dc8ffad003fc2e1857a39687b304d7a06e9cb5083726ebcba43ca95e003ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the fifth binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called the side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第五二项无理线段组成,则该区域一侧是无理线段,称为有理加上中项无理线段的区域的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07be1d4e4481cfdf5c170843a5bfbc1490f298d265fd88cebe0c79d83555951b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AC be contained by the rational straight line AB and the fifth binomial AD divided into its terms at E, so that AE is the greater term; I say that the side of the area AC is the irrational straight line called the side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC区由有理线段 AB区组成,第5 二项无理线段 AD区分为E区,因此AE区是较大的区;我说,AC区是无理线段个区,称为有理加中项无理线段个区的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70138991f0a160432ae48eb9f17f7faa8e2f18669ed816697b7aa6c28c2a5522","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the same construction be made as before shown; it is then manifest that MO is the side of the area AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"建造的工程与以前一样;然后显示MO是AC区域的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"62b6e1ef17aaebebdc702b801c27ca91fd003e730f5a6a760905c00d2ed10e1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then to be proved that MO is the side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,可以证明,MO是有理加中项无理线段地区的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba4ac4bdf4434ab166190cdec8058d4d1b37781b570773f65d8f8995ded7531b","citations":["euclid-10-18","euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AG is incommensurable with GE, [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)] therefore AH is also commensurable with HE, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] that is, the square on MN with the square on NO; therefore MN, NO are incommensurable in square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AG是不可公度,GE,AH也是可公度,HE, 也就是说,MN是正方形,NO是正方形;因此,MN,NO是正方形。  [ [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)] [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af5b5bd3c85d36e4ce74c061da35ae5f66929c105c41e0b79d8435082c5bad0f","citations":["euclid-10-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AD is a fifth binomial straight line, and ED the lesser segment, therefore ED is commensurable in length with AB. [[X. Deff. II. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD是第五条二项无理线段直线, ED是次线, 所以ED是长度可公度和AB。 [[X. Deff. II. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42414616c4aeee750c981394b05ee49c46edb0df4d5c3d47a57e223f3b0680b6","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE is incommensurable with ED; therefore AB is also incommensurable in length with AE. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE是不可公度,ED;因此,AB也是不可公度,AE。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c34f5b1ec9edbb94e0f3af39c705fc5d90219cd62bc253aed2c1c0e56b0b795","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AK, that is, the sum of the squares on MN, NO, is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AK,即MN,MN,NO的正方形,是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc6c4752ad2f9dcca75a5a3ce6284dfa9a81d8755fce88d0e8ca856f673d3800","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DE is commensurable in length with AB, that is, with EK, while DE is commensurable with EF, therefore EF is also commensurable with EK. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE是长度可公度,AB,EK,DE是可公度,EF,EK,EF也是可公度,EK。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3747b2b79819789b2ea1c20ec7755ed9dcf9165919dd4ebeb9d7c1e390bdacfe","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EK is rational; therefore EL, that is, MR, that is, the rectangle MN, NO, is also rational. [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EK是有理,EL,即MR,矩形、MN,NO也是有理。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71eafc5928e88977e13d94c60168a500d3d585cfa89735c8a23fbfdadba12b6d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MN, NO are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, but the rectangle contained by them rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,正方形的不可公度直线是MN,NO直线是正方形,中项无理线段直线是正方形直线,中项无理线段直线是有理直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af8003618103284add8c2ff184c26c576d07d4e1a4898a79fe79be71321f6984","citations":["euclid-10-40"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MO is the side of a rational plus a medial area [[X. 40](/principles/euclid-10-40)] and is the side of the area AC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MO是有理加中项无理线段地区的一侧,是AC、Q、E和D地区的一侧。 [[X. 40](/principles/euclid-10-40)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-58.source","contentId":"euclid-10-58","revisionId":"euclid-10-58@raw-41b90a85f248d0dd","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"595eba16f6b6414911e67ecc222de42233a1bd161fa01d36507912400039ba28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-58:euclid-10-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-58","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-58.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58/","sourceLabel":"X. 18"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-58:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-58","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-58.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.58/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-58:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-58","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-58.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","so